note One sibling box, all its members in the same lane. The box's top is level with its parent less lead_cross (so the first child is level with the parent) unless the lane is already used past that point, in which case it starts where the lane is free; top-level boxes have no parent and start where their lane is free. The members follow each other sibling_gap apart. The box is recorded in Built.siblings so the scene can draw it and the arrow keys can find siblings.

