note The lanes along the main axis: each rank's lane is as long as its longest node along that axis plus lead_main and pad_main; walking outward from rank 0 (clamped into the ranks present) in both directions, each lane starts rank_gap after the one before, so the tour's root keeps its place when a reveal opens a lane before it.

